# Baseline ignores — ordinary tool/interpreter caches from working in this
# repo (running tools/*.py per AGENTS.md). Generated-deliverable ignores for
# deck/ live in deck/.gitignore (practice 8) since they're scoped there.

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Generated by tools/routing_eval.py --emit; regenerate rather than track
evals/routing/prompts/

# Written at session start by tools/precedent_session_practices.py: the
# practices in force from the TEAM and INDIVIDUAL sources. Untracked on
# purpose and not negotiable -- this repository is public, that text is not,
# and committing it would publish private practice content on the very
# commit that added the convenience. See that tool's docstring.
.precedent/

# Per-machine Claude Code settings. commit-identity.sh derives an `env.TZ`
# into this file from whoever's identity.json resolved at session start, so a
# person's declared timezone reaches the whole session instead of having to
# be retyped on every commit. It is one contributor's environment, not the
# repository's: .claude/settings.json is the tracked, shared one.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Working copies Claude Code makes for background agents it runs in their
# own worktree. Scratch space, never work to commit; without this the stop
# hook refuses to end the turn over "untracked files" (2026-09-28).
.claude/worktrees/

# The local check ledger (tools/verify_harness.py): per-machine, never tracked
.cache/
